    "_postman_id": "a8546d71-7879-4e62-9be5-e3d96245f417",
    "name": "Marketplace Integration Configuration  API",
    "description": "The Integration Configuration API allows you to get a user's store list, associate your application, retrieve your application's configuration, update your application's configuration on a store, and remove your application entirely. Full documentation is available [here](https://developer.uber.com/docs/eats/guides/integration-activation-flows).\n\n## Before you start\n\n1. Make sure you have the **Uber Eats Marketplace API** Environment selected\n2. Fill the `uber_api_client_id`, `uber_api_client_secret`, and `store_id` variables.\n3. Click on the Authorization tab of this collection\n4. Scroll down and click Get Access Token\n5. After the token is generated successfully, click on Use Token",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52001179",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/6384856-a8546d71-7879-4e62-9be5-e3d96245f417?source=collection_link"
  },
