      "description": "**This guide provides step-by-step instructions for generating an 'eats.pos_provisioning' token in Postman using the 'authorization_code' grant type.**\n\n**Prerequisites and Notes:**\n\n1. Postman callback URL must be set within the Uber developer portal as a redirect URL.\n    \n2. Set your variables in Postman:\n    1. Client ID\n        \n    2. Client Secrets\n        \n    3. Scope\n        \n    4. Callback / Redirect URL\n        \n3. Ensure your browser pop-ups are not blocked. You will need to \"Login to Uber\" with the Uber Eats Manager credentials and you will retrieve your token within Postman + a refreshable token for this user.\n    \n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. **Postman -> Create Request → Authorization Page**\n    \n\n<img src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/8G3uR0ttPySBZs_wZQFzl0d69MS8vrBoqhe0E9fGg9YGrxUwqhZ0t-KEiBCrrLXS6T3pR31g4Q1tYFXgfklLVMtNacgW1j-dqjlJP9TLhiNgIPrTxkjJXClM63sZsm8oPaVGW5OpLINEoBnkUhlFkP0\">\n\n2\\. **Configure Variables**\n\n<img src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/zchnQPMI6ah1jY7p1Er8pUvw8fmqIPaUuYQHTfRvmTVAKaovIr1d6Tx5MwfI0h4uisWvU6FBUew2zqnMYgN091XiscGF7jGK5KD5-RYRtDfsUhfCBnlszg2zAgEaSeYWutu3PCw2JAbhaEj84EWGchU\">\n\n**3\\. Sample URLs to Configure**\n\nAuthorization URL\n\n**`https://auth.uber.com/oauth/v2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=[[uber_api_client_id]]&redirect_uri=https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback&scope=eats.pos_provisioning`**\n\nAccess Token URL\n\n**`https://auth.uber.com/oauth/v2/token?client_id=[[uber_api_client_id]]&client_secret=[[uber_api_client_secret]]&grant_type=authorization_code&code=`**\n\n**4\\. Execute the Flow**\n\nEnsure pop-ups are not blocked"
    },
